 "Datos básicos; verificar si cambian.": "Basic facts; verify in case they change.",
 "Lo básico": "The basics",
 "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#ffd166\">1787</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#d9d4f2\">Se firma en Filadelfia</span></div>": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#ffd166\">1787</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#d9d4f2\">Signed in Philadelphia</span></div>",
 "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#7dd3fc\">7 artículos</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#d9d4f2\">Organizan el gobierno</span></div>": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#7dd3fc\">7 articles</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#d9d4f2\">They organize the government</span></div>",
 "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#f9a8d4\">27 enmiendas</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#d9d4f2\">Los cambios aprobados</span></div>": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#f9a8d4\">27 amendments</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#d9d4f2\">The changes that have been approved</span></div>",
 "Empieza con «Nosotros, el pueblo».": "It begins with \"We the People.\"",
 "Resumen simplificado; para el texto exacto usar la fuente oficial.": "Simplified summary; use the official source for the exact text.",
